  * The artwork travels the production path: Song.thumbnailUrl ->
  * rememberRemoteArtworkUrl -> artworkAt (file URLs pass through untouched) ->
  * Coil file fetch.
+ *
+ * Pixels are captured in-JVM with captureToImage, not by reading back a
+ * Roborazzi output file: the plain unit-test task does not run in Roborazzi
+ * record mode, so no output file exists there. The bitmap is also written to
+ * build/outputs/roborazzi so the captures land in the shots artifact either
+ * way. The switch is exercised by toggling the same MutableStateFlow the
+ * production frost gate collects (rememberFrostEnabled), inside ONE
+ * composition - createComposeRule permits a single setContent per test.
  */
 @RunWith(RobolectricTestRunner::class)
 @GraphicsMode(GraphicsMode.Mode.NATIVE)
